  "This home is licensed by the Rhode Island Department of Health (RIDOH) but is not certified by Medicare or Medicaid, so it isn't in CMS's Care Compare data — the star ratings, staffing hours, health inspections, quality measures, and fines shown for other homes on this site all come from CMS and don't exist for this one.": "Este hogar tiene licencia del Departamento de Salud de Rhode Island (RIDOH) pero no está certificado por Medicare ni Medicaid, así que no figura en los datos de Care Compare de CMS. Las calificaciones de estrellas, las horas de personal, las inspecciones de salud, las medidas de calidad y las multas que se muestran para los otros hogares de este sitio vienen de CMS y no existen para este.",
  "This is a Special Focus Facility — CMS has flagged it as one of the worst-performing nursing homes in the country, with a track record of serious problems.": "Este es un Centro de Enfoque Especial. CMS lo ha señalado como uno de los hogares de ancianos con peor desempeño del país, con un historial de problemas graves.",
  "This page is published by Advocates for Better Care in Rhode Island (ABC-RI), an independent nonprofit advocacy organization. It is not produced, reviewed, or endorsed by CMS, the Rhode Island Department of Health (RIDOH), or any state agency, and it is not a substitute for their records.": "Esta página la publica Advocates for Better Care in Rhode Island (ABC-RI), una organización independiente de defensa sin fines de lucro. CMS, el Departamento de Salud de Rhode Island (RIDOH) y ninguna otra agencia estatal la producen, la revisan ni la respaldan, y no sustituye sus registros.",
